  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GZ-LAND ADMINISTRATION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project is to assess/learn the extent of commitment and readiness of the PA to reforming land administration by introducing policy, legal and institutional changes to achieve efficient procedures for the issuance of land titles and registration of property transactions, and transparent processes for the management and disposal of public land.</narrative>
  </description>
